<%#
AVR home page. Replaces upstream's homepage-splash block in catalog/index.html.erb.

Kept in its own partial so index.html.erb's AVR delta is a single line: upstream
reworks that file most releases (facet sidebar, constraints rendering, test ids),
and when it does you can take upstream's version wholesale and re-point the one
branch here. See docs/AVR_UPGRADE.md.

NOTE: this is styled with plain Bootstrap 5 utilities, which is what Avalon 8
ships. The AVR-branded version of this page used .hero-image / .contain-1120 /
.full-width-page from app/assets/stylesheets/northwestern/, which were dropped
during the 8.x upgrade and never replaced -- so from the 8.x upgrade until this
commit the home page rendered with no styling at all. Restoring the branding is
open work; see "Known gaps" in docs/AVR_CUSTOMIZATIONS.md.
%>
<div class="avr-home">
  <section class="avr-home-hero bg-body-secondary rounded-3 p-5 mb-4 text-center">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="display-5">Repository Audio + Video</h1>
      <p class="lead">Audio and video material for courses</p>
      <%= link_to 'Browse Collection',
                  main_app.search_catalog_path(search_field: 'all_fields', q: ''),
                  class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg mt-2" %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container pb-5">
    <h2 class="h4">Looking for Audio and Video material for Research?</h2>
    <p class="mb-0">
      All non-course media has moved to
      <%= link_to 'Northwestern University Libraries Digital Collections',
                  'https://dc.library.northwestern.edu/search?WorkType=%5B%22Audio%22%2C%22Video%22%5D' %>
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
